OL,3,GNEWSAGroup calls for former pub to
OL,4,Areopen as arts venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former pub could be turned into a
OL,7,Fspace for "artists and performers",
OL,8,Faccording to a group trying to reopen
OL,9,Fthe building.
OL,11,FThe Fall, The Housemartins and Bez from
OL,12,Fthe Happy Mondays have performed at the
OL,13,FRolleston Arms in Swindon, Wiltshire.
OL,15,FMarcus Kittridge, who is leading a
OL,16,Fgroup which has called on the council
OL,17,Fto protect the building, which is
OL,18,Fcurrently up for sale, said they "want
OL,19,Fa future where young people can enjoy
OL,20,Flive music and nights out, and artists
OL,21,Fand performers have somewhere to
OL,22,Fdevelop."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
