OL,3,GNEWSAGroup calls for former pub to
OL,4,Areopen as arts venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Swindon Borough
OL,7,FCouncil said: "We can confirm that a
OL,8,Fnomination to list the Rolleston Arms
OL,9,Fon Commercial Road as an Asset of
OL,10,FCommunity Value was received on 9
OL,11,FNovember."
